# Runtime artefacts: traces, reports and caches. Written as `data/*` rather than
# `data/` so git still descends into the directory and can see the exception
# below — it cannot re-include anything inside an excluded directory.
data/*
data/runs/
data/reports/
# The exception: the fund catalogue seed is source, not an artefact. Figures
# transcribed by hand from published fact sheets, and the golden set an extractor
# is later measured against. Archived PDFs stay ignored, being copies of the
# managers' own documents that the loader fetches.
!data/funds/
data/funds/mdd/
# Fact sheets and workbooks the curation scripts download to read. Same reason:
# copies of other people's published documents, re-fetchable from the URLs the
# seed already records.
scripts/curation/.cache/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.ipynb_checkpoints/
